Modifications: the context-insight feature set and UI information architecture
were ported from the dsh-context DeepSeek Harness plugin to the Antigravity
sidecar runtime. The implementation is plain JavaScript / HTML / CSS without a
build step, with a new data layer for Antigravity transcripts, language-service
context snapshots, token accounting and agent-family inference. Feature by
feature differences are documented in docs/parity-with-dsh-context.md.
